{
 "_comment": "KOBUY 購買（注文 → 限度額チェック → 多段承認 → 発注）の例題。**承認経路は各社に1本の固有のホーン節である**（橋田さん）——バイヤーごとに段数も承認者も違い標準形が無いので、経路そのものを代替節として書く。各組織が自分のスキーマに自社の節を1本持ち、頭部の会社で選ばれる。共有される部分（注文・限度額・発注）の節は1組のままで、会社が増えても増えない。",
 "@id": "urn:kobuy:ontology",
 "@type": "Ontology",
 "_ontoG": "ゴールはオントロジーの ontoG が指す（spec_kg.md 追記R367。Goal クラスは廃止した。追記K374）",
 "agentProperty": "urn:kobuy:agent",
 "defines": [
  {
   "@id": "urn:kobuy:Template",
   "@type": "Class",
   "subClassOf": [
    "#Template",
    {
     "@type": "Restriction",
     "onProperty": "#isComplete",
     "minCardinality": 0,
     "maxCardinality": 1
    }
   ],
   "label": {
    "ja": "テンプレート",
    "en": "Template"
   }
  },
  {
   "@id": "urn:kobuy:Atom",
   "@type": "Class",
   "subClassOf": [
    "#Atom",
    "urn:kobuy:Template"
   ],
   "label": {
    "ja": "アトムノード",
    "en": "Atom"
   }
  },
  {
   "@id": "urn:kobuy:Task",
   "@type": "Class",
   "subClassOf": [
    "#Task",
    "urn:kobuy:Atom"
   ],
   "label": {
    "ja": "タスクノード",
    "en": "Task"
   }
  },
  {
   "@id": "urn:kobuy:Constraint",
   "@type": "Class",
   "subClassOf": [
    "#Constraint",
    "urn:kobuy:Atom"
   ],
   "label": {
    "ja": "制約ノード",
    "en": "Constraint"
   }
  },
  {
   "@id": "urn:kobuy:OtherAtom",
   "@type": "Class",
   "subClassOf": [
    "#OtherAtom",
    "urn:kobuy:Atom"
   ],
   "label": {
    "ja": "その他のアトムノード",
    "en": "Other atom"
   }
  },
  {
   "@id": "urn:kobuy:Person",
   "@type": "Class",
   "label": {
    "ja": "人",
    "en": "Person"
   },
   "subClassOf": [
    "#Person"
   ]
  },
  {
   "@id": "urn:kobuy:agent",
   "@type": "ObjectProperty",
   "range": "urn:kobuy:Person",
   "label": {
    "ja": "担当者",
    "en": "Agent"
   },
   "subPropertyOf": [
    "#agent"
   ]
  },
  {
   "@id": "urn:kobuy:refersTo",
   "@type": "ObjectProperty",
   "label": {
    "ja": "参照",
    "en": "RefersTo"
   }
  },
  {
   "@id": "urn:kobuy:Geq",
   "@type": "Class",
   "subClassOf": [
    "urn:kobuy:Constraint"
   ],
   "#builtInFunction": "greaterEqual",
   "isConstraint": true,
   "label": {
    "ja": "≧",
    "en": "AtLeast"
   }
  },
  {
   "@id": "urn:kobuy:Then",
   "@type": "Class",
   "label": {
    "ja": "Then",
    "en": "Then"
   },
   "subClassOf": [
    "#Then"
   ]
  },
  {
   "@id": "arg1",
   "@type": "ObjectProperty",
   "label": {
    "ja": "第1引数",
    "en": "Arg 1"
   }
  },
  {
   "@id": "arg2",
   "@type": "ObjectProperty",
   "label": {
    "ja": "第2引数",
    "en": "Arg 2"
   }
  },
  {
   "@id": "urn:kobuy:注文者",
   "@type": "ObjectProperty",
   "range": "urn:kobuy:Person",
   "label": {
    "ja": "注文者",
    "en": "Orderer"
   }
  },
  {
   "@id": "urn:kobuy:金額",
   "@type": "DatatypeProperty",
   "range": "nonNegativeInteger",
   "label": {
    "ja": "金額",
    "en": "Amount"
   }
  },
  {
   "@id": "urn:kobuy:限度額",
   "@type": "DatatypeProperty",
   "range": "nonNegativeInteger",
   "label": {
    "ja": "限度額",
    "en": "Limit"
   }
  },
  {
   "@id": "urn:kobuy:利用者",
   "@type": "ObjectProperty",
   "range": "urn:kobuy:Person",
   "label": {
    "ja": "利用者",
    "en": "User"
   }
  },
  {
   "@id": "urn:kobuy:承認者",
   "@type": "ObjectProperty",
   "range": "urn:kobuy:Person",
   "label": {
    "ja": "承認者",
    "en": "Approver"
   }
  },
  {
   "_comment": "利用者ごとの限度額（マニュアル §3.1.5「利用者限度額一覧」）。**業務データであってアトムノードではない**ので Atom の下位にしない——頭部だけ・本体が空のホーン節＝事実として引かれる。",
   "@id": "urn:kobuy:利用者限度額",
   "@type": "Class",
   "subClassOf": [
    {
     "@type": "Restriction",
     "onProperty": "urn:kobuy:利用者",
     "minCardinality": 0,
     "maxCardinality": 1
    },
    {
     "@type": "Restriction",
     "onProperty": "urn:kobuy:限度額",
     "minCardinality": 0,
     "maxCardinality": 1
    }
   ],
   "label": {
    "ja": "利用者限度額",
    "en": "UserLimit"
   }
  },
  {
   "@id": "urn:kobuy:注文",
   "@type": "Class",
   "subClassOf": [
    "urn:kobuy:Task",
    "#Cancelable",
    {
     "@type": "Restriction",
     "onProperty": "urn:kobuy:金額",
     "minCardinality": 1,
     "maxCardinality": 1
    },
    {
     "@type": "Restriction",
     "onProperty": "urn:kobuy:agent",
     "minCardinality": 1,
     "maxCardinality": 1
    },
    {
     "@type": "Restriction",
     "onProperty": "#completeOrSuspendByOkButton",
     "minCardinality": 0,
     "maxCardinality": 1
    }
   ],
   "label": {
    "ja": "注文",
    "en": "Order"
   }
  },
  {
   "_comment": "承認は1段ぶんのタスク。担当者は経路のその段の承認者であり、ホーン節には書かれていない——データから流れてくる。",
   "@id": "urn:kobuy:承認",
   "@type": "Class",
   "subClassOf": [
    "urn:kobuy:Task",
    "#Cancelable",
    {
     "@type": "Restriction",
     "onProperty": "urn:kobuy:金額",
     "minCardinality": 1,
     "maxCardinality": 1
    },
    {
     "@type": "Restriction",
     "onProperty": "urn:kobuy:agent",
     "minCardinality": 1,
     "maxCardinality": 1
    },
    {
     "@type": "Restriction",
     "onProperty": "#completeOrSuspendByOkButton",
     "minCardinality": 0,
     "maxCardinality": 1
    }
   ],
   "label": {
    "ja": "承認",
    "en": "Approve"
   }
  },
  {
   "@id": "urn:kobuy:発注",
   "@type": "Class",
   "subClassOf": [
    "urn:kobuy:Task",
    {
     "@type": "Restriction",
     "onProperty": "urn:kobuy:金額",
     "minCardinality": 1,
     "maxCardinality": 1
    },
    {
     "@type": "Restriction",
     "onProperty": "urn:kobuy:agent",
     "minCardinality": 1,
     "maxCardinality": 1
    },
    {
     "@type": "Restriction",
     "onProperty": "#completeOrSuspendByOkButton",
     "minCardinality": 0,
     "maxCardinality": 1
    }
   ],
   "label": {
    "ja": "発注",
    "en": "PlaceOrder"
   }
  },
  {
   "@id": "urn:kobuy:Company",
   "@type": "Class",
   "label": {
    "ja": "会社",
    "en": "Company"
   }
  },
  {
   "@id": "urn:kobuy:会社",
   "@type": "ObjectProperty",
   "range": "urn:kobuy:Company",
   "label": {
    "ja": "会社",
    "en": "Company"
   }
  },
  {
   "_comment": "承認経路の承認者が差し戻す先のタスクのノード（呼び出し元が渡す。追記R848）。refersTo（retrieve）の下位属性で、値は呼び出し元の節の本体のタスク（注文）を指すだけ——Then・Else の arg と同じく、検索せず、編集権限を広げない（追記R850）",
   "@id": "urn:kobuy:差戻し先",
   "@type": "ObjectProperty",
   "range": "urn:kobuy:Task",
   "label": {
    "ja": "差戻し先",
    "en": "Send back to"
   },
   "subPropertyOf": "urn:kobuy:refersTo"
  },
  {
   "_comment": "承認経路。**節は会社ごとに1本**で、頭部の会社で選ばれる（代替節。Tag: 3-E）。本体にその会社の承認の並びを Then で書く。エンジンから見れば普通の代替節であり、経路の形を知る仕組みは要らない。",
   "@id": "urn:kobuy:承認経路",
   "@type": "Class",
   "subClassOf": [
    "urn:kobuy:OtherAtom",
    {
     "@type": "Restriction",
     "onProperty": "urn:kobuy:会社",
     "minCardinality": 1,
     "maxCardinality": 1
    },
    {
     "@type": "Restriction",
     "onProperty": "urn:kobuy:金額",
     "minCardinality": 1,
     "maxCardinality": 1
    },
    {
     "@type": "Restriction",
     "onProperty": "urn:kobuy:差戻し先",
     "minCardinality": 0,
     "maxCardinality": 1
    }
   ],
   "label": {
    "ja": "承認経路",
    "en": "ApprovalRoute"
   }
  },
  {
   "@id": "urn:kobuy:購買",
   "@type": "Class",
   "subClassOf": [
    "urn:kobuy:OtherAtom",
    {
     "@type": "Restriction",
     "onProperty": "urn:kobuy:注文者",
     "minCardinality": 1,
     "maxCardinality": 1
    },
    {
     "@type": "Restriction",
     "onProperty": "urn:kobuy:会社",
     "minCardinality": 1,
     "maxCardinality": 1
    }
   ],
   "label": {
    "ja": "購買",
    "en": "Purchase"
   }
  },
  {
   "@id": "urn:kobuy:購買ゴール",
   "@type": "Class",
   "subClassOf": [
    "urn:kobuy:Task"
   ],
   "label": {
    "ja": "購買ゴール",
    "en": "Purchase goal"
   }
  },
  {
   "@id": "urn:kobuy:購買ゴールB",
   "@type": "Class",
   "subClassOf": [
    "urn:kobuy:Task"
   ],
   "_comment": "B社の起動点。購買の節も承認の節も共有したまま、会社が違えば違う経路を辿ることを見せるためだけのもの。",
   "label": {
    "ja": "購買ゴール（B社）",
    "en": "Purchase goal (B)"
   }
  }
 ]
}
